    "description": {
      "en": "Sets the €1,000,000 upper band edge for couples in the CEHR schedule, used as Band_UpLim in tin_fr's SchedCalc (\"Exceptional contributions on high income earners: couples\"), above which the top CEHR rate applies to couples' reference income. Unlike the other two CEHR limits, it is used only within this schedule and not as a CDHR eligibility cut-off. The country report's Table 2.82 confirms the >€1,000,000 reference-income band for couples in the CEHR rate schedule."
